        "description": "<p>The first time you hit with a Favored attack on a Turn with a Finesse, Keen, or Ranged Weapon, it deals an extra d4 damage and ignores an amount of Armor equal to this number of extra dice. The number of extra d4s increases by 1 every 3 Levels hereafter.</p>",
